      "id": "claim_f65212ce7b0d457bb462ab3529184c0e",
      "statement": "`dsx.packet` defines strict immutable Pydantic packet contracts: a `dsx-packet/v1` packet has a SHA-256-bound dataset reference and one or more modules; module IDs are unique, module payloads must be standard JSON, and duplicate evidence references or tags within a module are rejected.",
